   glass sections (wall, depth, accordion, CTA) would sit on a flat navy slab. Three soft lobes (cyan, violet, rose,
   the hero's colours at a calmer level) are laid over the veil and drift slowly (transform only, running only while the
   hero is away). The lobes stay mid-dark (OKLCH L 36-45 %), so light text keeps 4.5:1. Day keeps its bright sky. */
  .sheen-sky[data-mode="hero"][data-style="aurora"]::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: -12%;
    z-index: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(38% 30% at 82% 14%, light-dark(transparent, oklch(46% 0.14 215 / 0.62)), transparent 72%),
      radial-gradient(40% 34% at 12% 38%, light-dark(transparent, oklch(41% 0.2 295 / 0.6)), transparent 72%),
      radial-gradient(36% 30% at 78% 66%, light-dark(transparent, oklch(40% 0.18 345 / 0.5)), transparent 72%),
      radial-gradient(42% 30% at 24% 92%, light-dark(transparent, oklch(44% 0.13 220 / 0.5)), transparent 72%);
    transition: opacity var(--sheen-duration-slower) var(--sheen-ease-out);
    animation: sheen-aurora-lobes var(--sheen-duration-aurora-lobes) var(--sheen-ease-in-out) infinite alternate;
    animation-play-state: paused;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .sheen-sky[data-mode="hero"][data-style="aurora"][data-away]::before {
    opacity: 1;
    animation-play-state: running;
  }

  .sheen-sky[data-mode="hero"][data-style="aurora"][data-away]::after {
    z-index: 0;
  }
}

@keyframes sheen-aurora-lobes {
  from {
    transform: translate3d(-2.5%, 1.5%, 0) scale(1);
