   mid-page (props tables, example cards) had nothing to frost. The same four lobes sit under it permanently,
   static (no animation, no blur, one gradient layer), at the hero-away level so text keeps AA. */
  .sheen-sky[data-mode="page"][data-style="aurora"]::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
    background:
      radial-gradient(42% 30% at 84% 20%, light-dark(transparent, oklch(46% 0.14 215 / 0.55)), transparent 72%),
      radial-gradient(44% 34% at 10% 46%, light-dark(transparent, oklch(41% 0.2 295 / 0.55)), transparent 72%),
      radial-gradient(40% 30% at 80% 74%, light-dark(transparent, oklch(40% 0.18 345 / 0.45)), transparent 72%),
