  /* ======================================================================
 * Preview stages (docs): vivid colour behind the glass in every style.
 * Crisp shapes (spheres, rings, a ribbon) next to soft light, so the blur reads at a glance.
 *
 * AA rule (measured from pixels): ghost buttons, captions and hints sit on the
 * BARE stage, and the most muted text token (--sheen-fg-subtle) must keep 4.5:1 over any pixel
 * of it. So every shape stays inside a luminance band: by day >= 0.61 (pastel, oklch L >= 86%
