@layer sheen {
  /*
 * Route transitions. The page is cross-faded as one flat
 * snapshot (glass blur baked in); the header and sidebar are identical in both snapshots, so they stay
 * visually still. The page title (one h1 per page, plain text) is its own layer and rises 8 px.
 * The attribute (on #main, else <html>) exists only while a transition runs. Reduced motion never starts one (the helper
 * checks), and the rules below also silence any that a browser starts on its own.
